sec.p:
Inclusion criteria:
Original research;
Study population of athlete(s) who were currently in training;
Not include a non-training experimental intervention;
Include a subjective self-report measure of athlete well-being with published validity and reliability;
Include an objective measure of athlete well-being; and
Have subjective and objective measures that coincide in timing, but not coincide with competition and be repeated at intervals reflective of the applied setting.
